    "Different outlets covering the same underlying story are counted as separate distinct articles; duplicate exposure of the same outlet/article is counted once",
    "Identical search depth (number of queries, results scanned) applied to every brand — Gucci was never searched more deeply than competitors",
    "Counts are recorded as observed; no smoothing or normalization applied even where coverage volume is genuinely uneven across brands"
